This repository builds inFAMOUS Reborn, the static recompilation of the
PlayStation 3 version of inFamous by whompay, for ARM64 handhelds:
https://github.com/whompay/inFAMOUSreborn
inFAMOUS Reborn publishes no licence for its game-specific code; it is not
stored here. The scripts download it from its own repository at build time,
at a pinned commit, and the patches here change it on your machine. Nothing
built from it is published here: you build the game yourself from your own
copy.

